nding to three, a strict mixed-noise versus projection-noise gap that survives a full-spark perturbation, and a deterministic frame sequence obstructing subharmonic Gaussian-target cost thresholds. An explicit Fourier reconstruction also produces low-cost coordinate bases in a classical conference-square family."}]],"$Ld"]}],"$Le",false,"$undefined","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12"]}]]}]]}],"$L13"]
